<div class="legal-notice-banner">
  <h2>Shop with Confidence</h2>
  <p>At <strong>Bike Bee</strong>, we stand behind the quality of our electric dirt bikes. If you're not completely satisfied with your purchase, we're here to help with our hassle-free return policy and 100-day warranty.</p>
</div>

<h2>30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h2>
<p>We offer a <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong> from the date of carrier delivery. If you're not satisfied with your purchase for any reason, you can return it within 30 days for a full refund.</p>

<div class="page-grid">
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>✅ 30 Days to Decide</h3>
    <p>Take your time to unbox and evaluate your machine at your convenience.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>✅ Full Purchase Refund</h3>
    <p>Get 100% of your product price refunded upon approved warehouse inspection.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>✅ Free Defective Returns</h3>
    <p>We cover 100% of return shipping costs for defective or transit-damaged items.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Eligibility for Returns</h2>

<h3>✅ Items That Can Be Returned</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Condition:</strong> Unused, unridden, in brand-new condition with zero odometer miles.</li>
  <li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Complete in original factory packaging and protective foam.</li>
  <li><strong>Accessories:</strong> All components included (charger, 2 keys, tool kit, manual).</li>
  <li><strong>Timeframe:</strong> Return initiated within 30 calendar days of documented delivery.</li>
  <li><strong>Proof of Purchase:</strong> Valid Bike Bee order confirmation.</li>
</ul>

<h3>❌ Items That Cannot Be Returned</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Bikes that have been ridden, assembled, or operated outdoors.</li>
  <li>Products with missing original packaging or damaged crates.</li>
  <li>Products damaged due to misuse, crashes, neglect, or aftermarket modifications.</li>
  <li>Items returned without prior written Return Authorization (RA) from Bike Bee.</li>
  <li>Gift cards or clearance/promotional items.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How to Return an Item</h2>

<div class="step-grid">
  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-number">1</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h4>Contact Us</h4>
      <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:contact@bikebee.shop">contact@bikebee.shop</a> within 30 days of delivery. Include your order number, reason for return, and photos.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-number">2</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h4>Receive Return Authorization (RA)</h4>
      <p>Our team will review your request within 24–48 hours and provide an RA number and shipping instructions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-number">3</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h4>Package Your Item</h4>
      <p>Securely repack the bike in its original packaging with all accessories, tools, manual, and mark your RA number clearly.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-number">4</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h4>Ship It Back</h4>
      <p>Hand over to the designated freight carrier. Keep your receipt and tracking number.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step-card">
    <div class="step-number">5</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <h4>Inspection & Refund</h4>
      <p>We inspect the item within 3–5 business days of warehouse receipt. Approved refunds are credited to your original payment method in 5–10 business days.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Return Shipping Costs</h2>
<h3>Free Returns</h3>
<p>We provide <strong>free return shipping</strong> for defective or damaged items, incorrect items shipped, or manufacturing defects covered under warranty.</p>

<h3>Customer-Paid Returns</h3>
<p>For change-of-mind returns, the customer is responsible for freight shipping expenses (typically <strong>$150–$300</strong> depending on location due to freight vehicle classifications).</p>

<h2>Refunds Timeline</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Inspection Period:</strong> 3–5 business days after warehouse arrival.</li>
  <li><strong>Processing Time:</strong> 5–10 business days after inspection approval.</li>
  <li><strong>Refund Method:</strong> Credited back to the original method of payment.</li>
</ul>

<h2>100-Day Warranty</h2>
<p>In addition to our 30-day return policy, all Bike Bee bikes come with a <strong>100-day warranty</strong> covering motor defects, lithium battery pack defects, motor controller failures, and main frame structural welds.</p>
<p><strong>Warranty does NOT cover:</strong> Normal wear and tear (tires, brake pads, chain), damage from crashes or jumps, water submersion, or unauthorized aftermarket modifications.</p>

<h2>Damaged or Defective Items</h2>
<p>If your bike arrives damaged: (1) Note damage on the carrier delivery slip before signing, (2) Do NOT assemble or ride the bike, (3) Take clear photos, and (4) Email <a href="mailto:contact@bikebee.shop">contact@bikebee.shop</a> within <strong>48 hours</strong>.</p>

<h2>Cancellations</h2>
<p>You can cancel your order <strong>free of charge within 2 hours of placement</strong>. Once shipped, standard return policies apply.</p>

<h2>Questions?</h2>
